# 11. FINANCIAL CALCULATIONS

Implement separate financial calculations for Inventory PR and Expense PR.

## 11.1 Inventory PR

Display:

- Inventory Subtotal.
- Header Charge Items.
- Line-Level Charge Items.
- Total Applicable Charges.
- Inventory Tax.
- Charge Item Tax.
- Total Landed PR Value.

Formula:

Total Landed PR Value =
Inventory Subtotal
+ Header Charge Items
+ Line-Level Charge Items
+ Applicable Taxes.

Ensure no duplicate charge or tax calculation.

## 11.2 Expense PR

Display:

- Expense Subtotal.
- Expense Tax.
- Total Expense PR Value.

Formula:

Total Expense PR Value =
Sum of Expense Line Base Amounts
+ Applicable Expense Taxes.

Do not include inventory amounts or inventory-linked Charge Items in Expense PR.

## 11.3 Calculation Controls

Support:

- Currency precision.
- Exchange rates.
- Fixed charges.
- Percentage-based charges.
- Tax-inclusive and tax-exclusive configuration, where supported.
- Rounding rules.
- Negative-value prevention.
- Mandatory amount validation.

Use decimal-safe calculations.

Do not rely exclusively on frontend calculations.

Backend totals must be authoritative.

