Koshit PR fields:

- Koshit PR ID.
- Company.
- Branch.
- PR Type.
- Requester.
- Approval Status.
- Approved Value.
- Integration Status.

SAP document fields:

- SAP Document Type.
- SAP DocEntry.
- SAP DocNum.
- Koshit Parent PR ID.
- Integration Timestamp.
- SAP Response.
- Integration Status.
- Error Details.

Implement:

- Idempotent document creation.
- Duplicate document prevention.
- Retry handling.
- Partial failure handling.
- SAP response logging.
- Integration reconciliation.

Use explicit integration states:

- NOT_STARTED.
- PENDING.
- INTEGRATED.
- FAILED.
- REQUIRES_RECONCILIATION.

If SAP confirms document creation but Koshit fails to record the response, reconcile the SAP document before attempting another creation.

Never blindly retry a transaction that may already have succeeded.

